Package: wp-rust-cache
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36)
Recommends: php-fpm | php-cli
Maintainer: Ostap Mykhaylyak <ostap.mykhaylyak@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ostap-mykhaylyak/wp-rust-cache
Description: shared-memory object cache for WordPress
 A persistent WordPress object cache in shared memory: PHP-FPM workers read
 and write one segment directly through a PHP extension, with no Redis, no
 Memcached, no network and no daemon.
 .
 This package ships the extension for PHP 8.2, 8.3, 8.4 and 8.5, the
 object-cache.php drop-in and the wp-rust-cache command. Nothing is enabled
 until you run: wp-rust-cache install --wp /path/to/wordpress
